 Boros guildhall.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16#:~:text=Krenko%20began%20his%20surveillance,the%20imposing%20Boros%20guildhall.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Krenko, Mob Boss","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16#:~:text=Krenko%20began%20his%20surveillance,the%20imposing%20Boros%20guildhall.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Krenko, Mob Boss\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16-e2","summary":"In the mess hall Krenko overhears Boros soldiers saying the guild's succession has come down to a duel, found by the Azorius in the fine print.","participants":["krenko","aurelia","feather","azorius-senate"],"location":"sunhome","importance":"major","page":"stories/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16","order":172,"story_date":"2012-07-16","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":19,"quote":"\"No, the nosy Azorius found it in the fine print,\" he said.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16#:~:text=%22No%2C%20the%20nosy%20Azorius,fine%20print%2C%22%20he%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Krenko, Mob Boss","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16#:~:text=%22No%2C%20the%20nosy%20Azorius,fine%20print%2C%22%20he%20said.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Krenko, Mob Boss\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"krenko-mob-boss-2012-07-16-e3","summary":"A fistfight breaks o